-- what a control instrument would have to be true for it to control anything: that the affinity
-- settles the membership, so a molecule with the same action on the same target falls inside the
-- class whenever another does.
AffinitySettles : BScope → Type 1
AffinitySettles s = (b1 : BindClaim) → (b2 : BindClaim) → bind-affinity b1 ≡ bind-affinity b2 → s (bind-mol b1) ≡ s (bind-mol b2)
